    justification:  # 926e
    description: "Python's _compute_stable_id() (py.py:836-877) omits containing_module_stable_id. Spec includes it. Two methods with identical signatures in different classes collide (Foo.process(x) == Bar.process(x)). Fix: include recursive parent stable_id in the hash. Bump STABLE_ID_SCHEME from v1 to v2 in schema.py. This is a prerequisite for Phase 2 (base-class stable_id generalization). See ADR-0014 §5."  # 926e
